  "notes": [
    "PK: primary key; FK: foreign key; UQ: unique; NULL: optional.",
    "Scoped business FKs include workspace_id; referenced rows expose UQ(workspace_id,id).",
    "Account workspace is NULL for platform roles; enterprise accounts have one workspace and one role.",
    "Case contains multiple AI Alerts; each AI Alert belongs to at most one case (proposed design selected by agent at user request).",
    "CaseAlert enforces AI kind through composite FK(workspace_id,alert_id,alert_kind) to Alert(workspace_id,id,kind).",
    "UQ(workspace_id,external_id) for transactions; UQ(workspace_id,version_no) for config versions; at most one active config per workspace.",
    "Field names/types/conversions are workspace-configured; transaction columns show system metadata, not a public input contract.",
    "Test runs retain metadata only. No sample payload/file, AI confidence, severity or risk score is stored.",
    "Staff assignments keep history; the maximum simultaneous active Staff count remains pending.",
    "State values, recovery scheduling, alert reconciliation, retention and key management remain open; no enum or deletion cascade is selected."
  ]
